## CQ-FBS-01
@group client
@commands Launch; grep latest.log for `FallingBlockWaterSplash` and `Mixin` errors
@pass No mixin error; client reaches the title screen
@fails Name the mixin; SRG id m_8119_ (FallingBlockEntity.tick)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell ! grep -iE "Mixin apply.*FallingBlockWaterSplash|FallingBlockWaterSplash.*(error|fail)" logs/latest.log
do {"assert_screen": "none"}
look the client reached the world (the driver only runs in game, so the title screen was passed)
## CQ-FBS-02
@group client
@commands Over a pool: `/summon falling_block ~ ~20 ~ {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:anvil"},HurtEntities:1b}`; sand from 2 blocks up
@pass Each splashes once on entering water (Effective model, droplets, sound); the high drop splashes larger
@fails No splash: tail inject not reached or `level` not ClientLevel
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill ~-3 ~-1 ~2 ~3 ~-4 ~8 minecraft:water
do {"look": {"yaw": 0, "pitch": 30}}
> summon minecraft:falling_block ~ ~20 ~5 {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:anvil"},HurtEntities:1b}
do {"wait": 22}
shot anvil_splash
> summon minecraft:falling_block ~2 ~2 ~5 {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:sand"}}
do {"wait": 6}
shot sand_splash
look one splash per block on entering the water (Effective model droplets), the anvil's from 20 up larger than the sand's; sound is not captured (owner, if wanted)
## CQ-FBS-03
@group client
@commands Same drops over dry ground; watch a block in water
@pass No splash on dry ground; no sideways push by the water
@fails Splash on land: fluid check wrong
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> fill ~-3 ~-1 ~-8 ~3 ~-1 ~-2 minecraft:stone
do {"look": {"yaw": 180, "pitch": 30}}
> summon minecraft:falling_block ~ ~10 ~-5 {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:sand"}}
do {"wait": 16}
shot dry_landing
> fill ~-3 ~-1 ~2 ~3 ~-4 ~8 minecraft:water
> summon minecraft:falling_block ~ ~6 ~5 {BlockState:{Name:"minecraft:gravel"}}
do {"look": {"yaw": 0, "pitch": 30}}
do {"wait": 30}
shot in_water
look no splash on dry ground; the gravel in water sinks straight (no sideways push)
